{
  "uid": "oeds-ecmwf",
  "title": "OEDS ECMWF Weather (ERA5)",
  "tags": [
    "oeds",
    "weather",
    "ecmwf"
  ],
  "timezone": "browser",
  "editable": true,
  "graphTooltip": 1,
  "refresh": "",
  "schemaVersion": 39,
  "version": 1,
  "description": "Hourly ECMWF reanalysis weather (2 m temperature, wind, solar irradiation, precipitation) on a 0.1 degree grid and aggregated per NUTS region.",
  "time": {
    "from": "2026-01-21T00:00:00.000Z",
    "to": "2026-02-21T20:00:00.000Z"
  },
  "panels": [
    {
      "type": "row",
      "title": "Data status",
      "collapsed": false,
      "panels": [],
      "id": 1,
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 0,
        "w": 24,
        "h": 1
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "table",
      "title": "Data status",
      "description": "First and latest timestamp per table, age of the latest value and approximate row count. Status compares the age with the update cadence of the source: OK within the expected age, LATE up to 3x, STALE beyond; 'static' tables are not updated any more.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "grafana-postgresql-datasource",
        "uid": "${ds}"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "grafana-postgresql-datasource",
            "uid": "${ds}"
          },
          "editorMode": "code",
          "format": "table",
          "rawQuery": true,
          "rawSql": "SELECT 'ecmwf.ecmwf (grid)' AS \"Table\", (min(\"time\") AT TIME ZONE 'UTC') AS \"First\", (max(\"time\") AT TIME ZONE 'UTC') AS \"Latest\", round((extract(epoch FROM now() - (max(\"time\") AT TIME ZONE 'UTC'))/3600)::numeric, 1) AS \"Age (h)\", approximate_row_count('ecmwf.ecmwf'::regclass) AS \"Rows (approx.)\", 48 AS \"Expected max age (h)\", CASE WHEN extract(epoch FROM now() - (max(\"time\") AT TIME ZONE 'UTC'))/3600 <= 48 THEN 'OK' WHEN extract(epoch FROM now() - (max(\"time\") AT TIME ZONE 'UTC'))/3600 <= 144 THEN 'LATE' ELSE 'STALE' END AS \"Status\" FROM ecmwf.ecmwf\nUNION ALL\nSELECT 'ecmwf.ecmwf_eu (NUTS regions)' AS \"Table\", (min(\"time\") AT TIME ZONE 'UTC') AS \"First\", (max(\"time\") AT TIME ZONE 'UTC') AS \"Latest\", round((extract(epoch FROM now() - (max(\"time\") AT TIME ZONE 'UTC'))/3600)::numeric, 1) AS \"Age (h)\", approximate_row_count('ecmwf.ecmwf_eu'::regclass) AS \"Rows (approx.)\", 48 AS \"Expected max age (h)\", CASE WHEN extract(epoch FROM now() - (max(\"time\") AT TIME ZONE 'UTC'))/3600 <= 48 THEN 'OK' WHEN extract(epoch FROM now() - (max(\"time\") AT TIME ZONE 'UTC'))/3600 <= 144 THEN 'LATE' ELSE 'STALE' END AS \"Status\" FROM ecmwf.ecmwf_eu"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "custom": {
            "align": "auto",
            "cellOptions": {
              "type": "auto"
            }
          }
        },
        "overrides": [
          {
            "matcher": {
              "id": "byName",
              "options": "Status"
            },
            "properties": [
              {
                "id": "custom.cellOptions",
                "value": {
                  "type": "color-background",
                  "mode": "basic"
                }
              },
              {
                "id": "mappings",
                "value": [
                  {
                    "type": "value",
                    "options": {
                      "OK": {
                        "color": "green",
                        "text": "OK",
                        "index": 0
                      },
                      "LATE": {
                        "color": "orange",
                        "text": "LATE",
                        "index": 1
                      },
                      "STALE": {
                        "color": "red",
                        "text": "STALE",
                        "index": 2
                      },
                      "static": {
                        "color": "blue",
                        "text": "static",
                        "index": 3
                      }
                    }
                  }
                ]
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "matcher": {
              "id": "byName",
              "options": "Age (h)"
            },
            "properties": [
              {
                "id": "unit",
                "value": "h"
              },
              {
                "id": "decimals",
                "value": 1
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "matcher": {
              "id": "byName",
              "options": "Rows (approx.)"
            },
            "properties": [
              {
                "id": "unit",
                "value": "short"
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "matcher": {
              "id": "byName",
              "options": "First"
            },
            "properties": [
              {
                "id": "unit",
                "value": "dateTimeAsIso"
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "matcher": {
              "id": "byName",
              "options": "Latest"
            },
            "properties": [
              {
                "id": "unit",
                "value": "dateTimeAsIso"
              }
            ]
          }
        ]
      },
      "options": {
        "showHeader": true,
        "cellHeight": "sm"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 1,
        "w": 14,
        "h": 5
      },
      "id": 2
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "title": "About this data",
      "datasource": null,
      "options": {
        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "Hourly ERA5-style reanalysis, **UTC**. `ecmwf.ecmwf` is the raw 0.1 degree grid (about 130 000 cells per hour, 4.7 billion rows: always filter on a single hour or a short range); `ecmwf.ecmwf_eu` has one row per NUTS region and hour (1 943 regions, 70 million rows).\n\nUnits used here: temperature K to degC, `ghi` J/m2 per hour to W/m2 (divide by 3600), precipitation m to mm. The download is still running, so the data currently ends on 2026-02-21; the default range shows the last month available."
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {},
        "overrides": []
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 14,
        "y": 1,
        "w": 10,
        "h": 5
      },
      "id": 3
    },
    {
      "type": "row",
      "title": "Europe at the latest hour of the selected range",
      "collapsed": false,
      "panels": [],
      "id": 4,
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 6,
        "w": 24,
        "h": 1
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "Hour shown",
      "description": "Latest hour with data inside the selected time range. All panels of this row show this hour.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "grafana-postgresql-datasource",
        "uid": "${ds}"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "grafana-postgresql-datasource",
            "uid": "${ds}"
          },
          "editorMode": "code",
          "format": "table",
          "rawQuery": true,
          "rawSql": "SELECT to_char(max(\"time\"), 'YYYY-MM-DD HH24:MI \"UTC\"') AS \"hour\" FROM ecmwf.ecmwf_eu WHERE $__timeFilter(\"time\")"
        }
      ],
